assertion: candidate == -(shipped) componentwise -> PASS
i.e. refract(-I, -N, eta) == -refract(I, N, eta): the two candidate one-line
fixes in the work order are the SAME expression. Both yield the propagation
direction of sunlight inside the water (y <= 0 in daytime).

